#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path, on each poller that reads nodes, to the private key whose public half each node lists in authorized_keys with a forced command running pfs-read.sh. Readable only by the poller user. The plugin never creates, copies, or prints it."
msgstr "Lalana feno, eo amin'ny mpanangona tsirairay mamaky teboka, mankany amin'ny fanalahidy manokana izay ny antsasany imasom-bahoaka dia voatanisan'ny teboka tsirairay ao amin'ny authorized_keys miaraka amin'ny baiko voatery mandefa ny pfs-read.sh. Ny mpampiasa mpanangona ihany no mahavaky azy. Tsy mamorona, mandika, na manonta azy velively ny plugin."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Key File"
msgstr "Rakitra fanalahidy SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the known_hosts file holding each node host key under the node endpoint name. A node whose key is missing or changed is not read."
msgstr "Lalana feno mankany amin'ny rakitra known_hosts mitahiry ny fanalahidin'ny mpampiantranon'ny teboka tsirairay eo ambanin'ny anaran'ny teboka fiafarana. Tsy vakina ny teboka izay tsy misy na niova ny fanalahidiny."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Known Hosts File"
msgstr "Rakitra known_hosts"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Fetram-potoana fifandraisana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds to wait for a node to accept the connection."
msgstr "Segondra andrasana mba hanaiky ny fifandraisana ny teboka."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Read Timeout"
msgstr "Fetram-potoana famakiana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node read may take in total before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Segondra azon'ny famakiana teboka iray alaina amin'ny fitambarany alohan'ny hanajanona azy sy hiraketana azy ho tsy nahomby."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one node may return. A larger answer is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB azon'ny teboka iray averina. Ariany sy raketiny ho tsy nahomby ny valinteny lehibe kokoa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response"
msgstr "Valinteny lehibe indrindra"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Mpamaky"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Fetram-potoana ho an'ny mpamaky"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend before it stops starting node reads. Keep it below the poller interval; unread nodes are read on the next run."
msgstr "Segondra azon'ny fandehanana mpamaky iray laniana alohan'ny hitsaharany tsy hanomboka famakiana teboka. Ataovy latsaky ny elanelam-potoanan'ny mpanangona izany; vakina amin'ny fandehanana manaraka ireo teboka tsy voavaky."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Concurrent Reads"
msgstr "Famakiana miaraka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node reads one reader runs at the same time."
msgstr "Famakiana teboka alefan'ny mpamaky iray miaraka amin'ny fotoana iray."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Fanesorana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Tazomy ny tabilaon'ny plugin rehefa manaisotra"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its filesystems, nodes, inventory, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the registry first from the Parallel Filesystem Admin page. Storage nodes are never contacted either way."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, ny fanesorana ny plugin dia mitazona ny rafitra rakitrany, ny tebony, ny lisitry ny fananana, ary ny tahiry vonjimaika. Esory ny marika mba hamafan'ny fanesorana azy ireo; aondrano aloha ny firaketana avy amin'ny pejy Fitantanana Rafitra rakitra mirazotra. Tsy ifandraisana velively ny teboka fitahirizana na ahoana na ahoana."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delete the Devices This Plugin Created on Uninstall"
msgstr "Fafao ireo fitaovana noforonin'ity plugin ity rehefa esorina"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin deletes the devices it created for filesystems, with their graphs and data sources, as deleting them in Cacti would. Existing devices that were mapped to a filesystem are never deleted. RRD files are removed only if Cacti's own RRD cleanup setting removes them. Cleared, the devices stay."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, ny fanesorana ny plugin dia mamafa ireo fitaovana noforoniny ho an'ny rafitra rakitra, miaraka amin'ny kisariny sy ny loharanon'angony, toy ny famafana azy ao amin'ny Cacti. Tsy voafafa velively ireo fitaovana efa nisy izay nampifandraisina tamin'ny rafitra rakitra iray. Ny rakitra RRD dia tsy esorina raha tsy ny fikirakirana fanadiovana RRD an'i Cacti mihitsy no mamafa azy. Raha tsy voamarika dia mijanona ny fitaovana."

