msgid "That record belongs to a Cacti device you do not have permission for. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "An'ny fitaovana Cacti izay tsy anananao fahazoan-dalana io firaketana io. Tsy nisy novaina."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another filesystem of this backend already uses this name."
msgstr "Anarana: efa mampiasa ity anarana ity ny rafitra rakitra hafa amin'ity rafitra aoriana ity."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem could not be saved."
msgstr "Tsy voatahiry ny rafitra rakitra."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem was saved."
msgstr "Voatahiry ny rafitra rakitra."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem, its nodes, and its inventory were deleted. Its Cacti device, data sources, and graphs were kept. No node was contacted."
msgstr "Voafafa ny rafitra rakitra, ny tebony, ary ny lisitry ny fananana. Notazonina ny fitaovana Cacti, ny loharanon'angona, ary ny kisariny. Tsy nisy teboka nifandraisana."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another node already uses this name."
msgstr "Anarana: efa mampiasa ity anarana ity ny teboka hafa."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node could not be saved."
msgstr "Tsy voatahiry ny teboka."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was saved."
msgstr "Voatahiry ny teboka."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was deleted. Targets it reported keep their history."
msgstr "Voafafa ny teboka. Mitazona ny tantarany ireo tanjona notateriny."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Enter a network as an address and prefix length, such as 10.20.0.0/16."
msgstr "Ampidiro ny tambajotra amin'ny alalan'ny adiresy sy ny halavan'ny tovana aloha, toy ny 10.20.0.0/16."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "No device was added: the filesystem already has one, or the templates are not installed."
msgstr "Tsy nisy fitaovana nampiana: efa manana iray ny rafitra rakitra, na tsy tafapetraka ny lasitra."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device could not be mapped. It may be mapped to another filesystem."
msgstr "Tsy afaka nampifandraisina ny fitaovana. Mety efa mifandray amin'ny rafitra rakitra hafa izy io."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device was mapped and the data queries and overview graphs were added."
msgstr "Nampifandraisina ny fitaovana ary nampiana ny fangatahana angona sy ny kisary famintinana."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Cacti did not create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Tsy namorona ny fitaovana i Cacti. Jereo ny firaketan'i Cacti."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "Noforonina ny fitaovana, ny fangatahana angona, ary ny kisary famintinana."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Tsy mifandray intsony ny fitaovana. Notazonina izy sy ny kisariny; tsy mitanisa tanjona ny fangatahana angonany raha tsy mifandray indray."

#: pfs_health.php
